# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# NOTHING BELOW THIS LINE. Do not add documents or test files here.
#
# This block used to contain ignore rules for every .md file in the project and for
# Phase6Test.java. Phase 5, 6 and 7 each reported it "fixed" and each time the entries were
# still here, so a fresh clone contained one document (README.md) and ran 14 fewer tests
# than this machine did. Removed for real in Phase 8; see PHASE-8-REPORT.md, B7.
#
# PROTOCOL.md is the wire specification, LEARNING-LOG.md is the design record, and the
# PHASE-n files are the write-ups. Phase 10 requires them to be linked from the README, so
# a clone has to contain them.
#
# Verify with the command, not by reading the diff:
#     git add -A && git ls-files "*.md" | wc -l      -> expect 10, not 1
#     git ls-files "src/test/**/Phase*.java" | wc -l -> expect 3
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
